      "writtenOn": "2020-12-17T18:26:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, it would be a shame to pollute housekeeping functions.\n\nAlso. in this case, we bail-out directly here. But if the CPU is inactive it is very unlikely it\u0027ll be found in the sched_domain below. So basically we bypass completely the search for a !idle CPU, which would waste energy.\n\nIf a CPU isn\u0027t active, it\u0027s probably a better approach to look for a !idle CPU in a linear way.",
