      "message": "will there be a case where we don\u0027t find an online CPU at all?\n\nWe are giving least priority to isolation/housekeeping here. however that conflicts with housekeeping cpumask check in the for loop above.\n\nSince it is unlikely that we use CPU isolation/house keeping, can we give more priority to it? The best part is you don\u0027t have to make a change here at this line. it will look something like this.\n\ndiff --git a/kernel/sched/isolation.c b/kernel/sched/isolation.c\nindex 5a6ea03..4ae41d4 100644\n--- a/kernel/sched/isolation.c\n+++ b/kernel/sched/isolation.c\n@@ -30,6 +30,10 @@ int housekeeping_any_cpu(enum hk_flags flags)\n                        if (cpu \u003c nr_cpu_ids)\n                                return cpu;\n\n+                       cpu \u003d cpumask_any_and(housekeeping_mask, cpu_active_mask);\n+                       if (cpu \u003c nr_cpu_ids)\n+                               return cpu;\n+\n                        return cpumask_any_and(housekeeping_mask, cpu_online_mask);\n                }\n        }",
